When adding or editing how-to recipes, or when the user pastes a support
ticket / email / phone notes / chat and wants it captured, follow
`docs/howto-recipes/AGENTS.md`. Use `_template.md`. One task per file.
Redact PII. Do not publish to Starlight Common Tasks unless asked.
